.TH GAET 1
.SH NAME
gaet \- PostgreSQL Backup \& Sync CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gaet
.RI [ COMMAND ]
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
gaet is a zero\-dependency PostgreSQL backup CLI that syncs local databases
to any cloud PostgreSQL instance (Supabase, Neon, AWS RDS, or any VPS).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B gaet init
Interactive setup wizard (auto\-detects local PostgreSQL).
.TP
.B gaet push
Backup local database to cloud. Add
.B \-\-auto
to schedule periodic backups.
.TP
.B gaet fetch
Restore cloud database to local (overwrites local DB).
.TP
.B gaet status
Show per\-table sync status between local and cloud.
.TP
.B gaet check
Validate configuration and test all connections.
.TP
.B gaet doctor
Comprehensive health check (config, tools, DB, backups, scheduler).
.TP
.B gaet diff
Compare local vs cloud tables and row counts side by side.
.TP
.B gaet log
View backup log. Add
.B \-\-follow
for real\-time tailing.
.TP
.B gaet serve
Start web dashboard at http://localhost:9191.
.TP
.B gaet get
Show all or specific config variables (passwords masked).
.TP
.B gaet set
Set config variables. Empty value deletes the key.
.TP
.B gaet install
Setup/install dependencies, config, and system services.
.TP
.B gaet help
Show help for a command (e.g. \fBgaet help push\fR).
.TP
.B gaet export
Print config as shell\-compatible
.B export
statements.
.TP
.B gaet completion
Generate shell completions for bash, zsh, or fish.
.TP
.B gaet update
Update to latest version from GitHub.
.TP
.B gaet uninstall
Remove gaet (use
.B \-\-purge
to remove config and backups too).
.TP
.B gaet stop
Stop auto\-backup and/or dashboard services.
.SH CONFIGURATION
.TP
.B GAET_LOCAL_DB_HOST
Local PostgreSQL host (default: /run/postgresql Unix socket).
.TP
.B GAET_LOCAL_DB_NAME
Local database name.
.TP
.B GAET_LOCAL_DB_USER
Local database user.
.TP
.B GAET_LOCAL_DB_PASS
Local database password (optional for trust auth).
.TP
.B GAET_REMOTE_URL
Cloud PostgreSQL connection URL (e.g. postgresql://user:pass@host:port/db).
.TP
.B GAET_REMOTE_SSLMODE
SSL mode for remote connection (default: prefer). Use \fBrequire\fR only if SSL is mandatory.
.TP
.B GAET_PG_TIMEOUT
Per\-operation timeout in seconds for pg_dump/pg_restore (default: 120). Increase for large databases (>1 GB).
.TP
.B GAET_RETENTION_DAYS
Number of days to keep local backups (default: 7).
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Suppress non\-essential output (for scripts/CI).
.TP
.BR \-\-plain
Plain, decoration\-free output (pipe\-safe for grep/awk/jq).
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Show version and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
gaet init                      # First\-time setup
gaet push                      # Backup local \u2192 cloud
gaet push \-\-dry\-run           # Simulate backup
gaet push \-\-auto=6            # Schedule every 6 hours
gaet fetch                     # Restore cloud \u2192 local
gaet status                    # Show sync status
gaet status \-\-json            # Machine\-readable status
gaet check \-\-json | jq        # Pipeline with jq
gaet log \-\-follow             # Real\-time log tailing
gaet diff                       # Compare local vs cloud
gaet doctor                     # Health check
gaet completion \-\-shell bash   # Install bash completions
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.gaet/.env
Configuration file (created with 0600 permissions).
.TP
.I ~/.gaet/backups/
Local backup storage directory.
.TP
.I ~/.gaet/backups/cron.log
Auto\-backup log.
.SH EXIT CODES
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
General failure.
.TP
.B 2
Usage / argument error.
.TP
.B 80
Configuration error (missing/invalid .env).
.TP
.B 81
Local database unreachable.
.TP
.B 82
Cloud/remote database unreachable.
.TP
.B 83
Lock held by another process.
.TP
.B 84
PostgreSQL tools not found.
